<mxCell id="p0-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Order calls CreateTransaction during PlaceOrder and the shopper waits. Payment saves the transaction first, then asks Omise for a charge with capture off. A wallet tender calls Wallet Hold instead and returns no authorize_url. No Kafka, so no Ack.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
