<mxCell id="p0-v29" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields (draft)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v30" parent="p0-v29" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc CreateTransaction(CreateTransactionRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (CreateTransactionResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message CreateTransactionRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string idempotency_key = 1;  // Order: order_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string purpose         = 2;  // order | top_up&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string order_id        = 3;  // empty for top_up&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string customer_id     = 4;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  amount_satang   = 5;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string currency        = 6;  // THB&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string method          = 7;  // card | promptpay | qr&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string return_uri      = 8;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message CreateTransactionResponse {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string transaction_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string status         = 2;  // authorizing&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string authorize_url  = 3;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;Omise charge metadata: brand_id · transaction_id" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v31" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v32" parent="p0-v31" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="transactions&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;transaction_id PK · brand_id · purpose&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;order_id · customer_id · amount_satang&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status · version&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;idempotency_key  UNIQUE(brand_id, key)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;attempts&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;attempt_id · transaction_id · provider&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;payment_ref UNIQUE · status · created_at&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox: nothing yet.&lt;br&gt;payment.events{authorized | failed}&lt;br&gt;leaves on the webhook (LLD 2)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v33" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v34" parent="p0-v33" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Dedupe: UNIQUE(brand_id, idempotency_key). A repeat returns the stored response.&lt;br&gt;• Commit before calling Omise, so a crash mid-call leaves a row the webhook can match.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline: passed down from customer-bff through Order. The Omise call uses what is left.&lt;br&gt;• Retry: Order retries UNAVAILABLE with the same key. A new attempt row is made; the transaction is the same." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v35" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v36" parent="p0-v35" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• D-02: Order is the only caller for an order payment. customer-bff calls only for a top-up.&lt;br&gt;• P-01: idempotency_key is required here.&lt;br&gt;• Auth then capture: money moves only after the POS accepts (LLD 3).&lt;br&gt;• Payment trusts the amount Order sends (cost recorded on D-02).&lt;br&gt;• 2C2P is a port and is not shipped. Rider payout is TrueMoney (LLD 6), not a second charge provider." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="2 · Gateway webhook" id="lld-1"><mxGraphModel dx="1980" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1980" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
<mxCell id="p1-v1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;" value="Payment LLD 2 — Gateway webhook: the charge result becomes authorized or failed" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="12" width="1920" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Omise calls the webhook when 3DS or the QR payment finishes. webhook-adapter checks the signature and publishes payment.requested{webhook}. Payment moves the transaction and publishes the fact.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#C2410C;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;" value="gRPC  ·  sync, the caller waits" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="86" width="360" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
