<mxCell id="p1-v36" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields (draft)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v37" parent="p1-v36" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="topic payment.requested  key brand_id:transaction_id&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message PaymentRequested {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string transaction_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;oneof request {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Capture capture = 10;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Void    void    = 11;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Webhook webhook = 12;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Payout  payout  = 13;  // rider · LLD 6&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;}&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message Webhook {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string provider       = 1;  // omise&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string payment_ref    = 2;  // Omise charge id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string provider_event = 3;  // charge.complete&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string status         = 4;  // successful | failed&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string failure_code   = 5;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  occurred_at    = 6;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;The raw body stays at the adapter; the&lt;br&gt;command carries only these fields." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v38" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v39" parent="p1-v38" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="processed_event&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;event_id PK · topic · applied_at&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;transactions&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status · version + 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;attempts&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status · failure_code&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox (same transaction)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;payment.events{authorized}&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;payment.events{failed  reason}" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v40" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v41" parent="p1-v40" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Command, so dedupe on event_id in processed_event, same transaction.&lt;br&gt;• Omise can send the same webhook twice with different event ids; the state machine makes the second one a no-op.&lt;br&gt;• Retry 3× with backoff, then payment.dlq, then Ack.&lt;br&gt;• Key brand_id:transaction_id keeps webhook, capture, void, and payout for one transaction in order." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v42" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v43" parent="p1-v42" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A domain never exposes a webhook to the internet (§4).&lt;br&gt;• webhook-adapter only checks and publishes. It never calls Payment over gRPC.&lt;br&gt;• The adapter takes brand_id and transaction_id from the charge metadata set in LLD 1.&lt;br&gt;• Whether Payment re-reads the charge from Omise before applying is to be decided with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
