<mxCell id="p2-v1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;" value="Payment LLD 3 — Capture and void: a command from Order, then the gateway worker" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="12" width="1920" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Order publishes capture after the POS accepts, or void after a reject or a timeout. Payment commits the intent and Acks. The gateway worker calls Omise after the commit. A wallet tender calls Wallet Capture or Release instead.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
