<mxCell id="p3-v31" parent="p3-v30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc Refund(RefundRequest) returns (RefundResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message RefundRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string idempotency_key = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string transaction_id  = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  amount_satang   = 3;  // partial allowed&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string reason          = 4;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message RefundResponse {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string refund_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string status    = 2;  // pending&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;metadata: x-brand-id · x-principal-id · x-roles" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v32" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v33" parent="p3-v32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="refunds&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;refund_id PK · transaction_id · brand_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;amount_satang · reason · status&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;idempotency_key  UNIQUE(brand_id, key)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;requested_by (principal)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;transactions&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;refunded_satang · version + 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox: gateway job, then payment.events&lt;br&gt;audit_log: same transaction" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v34" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v35" parent="p3-v34" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Dedupe: UNIQUE(brand_id, idempotency_key).&lt;br&gt;• The amount check and the insert run in one transaction with the transaction row locked, so two agents cannot over-refund.&lt;br&gt;• Omise refund 5xx: 3× with backoff, then failed and an alert to CSC." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v36" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v37" parent="p3-v36" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Refund stays gRPC because the admin is waiting (HLD decision).&lt;br&gt;• P-01: idempotency_key is required here.&lt;br&gt;• Order ignores refunded; the order status does not change.&lt;br&gt;• admin-bff checks the refund grant. Payment trusts X-Roles." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="5 · Statement mode" id="lld-4"><mxGraphModel dx="1980" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1980" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
<mxCell id="p4-v1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;" value="Payment LLD 5 — Statement mode: the tax invoice after captured" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="12" width="1920" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="When a capture commits, the same transaction adds a statement job. A delivered FAAS trip arrives on delivery.events, is invoiced here, and is Acked. Payment in statement mode renders the invoice and the receipt to S3. Same app, not a topic and not a service, so there is no Ack.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
