<mxCell id="p4-v30" parent="p4-v29" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• UNIQUE(transaction_id) on invoices: a rerun after a crash finds the row and stops.&lt;br&gt;• The S3 put uses the same key, so writing twice is harmless.&lt;br&gt;• No caller waits, so there is no deadline from a client; the job has a 30 s timeout (draft)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v31" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v32" parent="p4-v31" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Statement is a mode of this app and runs after the same commit (HLD decision).&lt;br&gt;• It does not subscribe to payment.events. It does consume delivery.events delivered for a FAAS invoice, then Ack.&lt;br&gt;• The source of line items on a full tax invoice is to be decided with the business.&lt;br&gt;• A refund credit note is not drawn yet." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
