<mxCell id="p5-ct" parent="p5-c" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="topic payment.requested  key brand_id:transaction_id&lt;br&gt;brand_id header is mfg&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message Payout {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string payout_id     = 1;  // Delivery chooses it&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string delivery_id   = 2;  // transaction_id = payout_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string rider_id      = 3;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  amount_satang = 4;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;payment.events&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;paid_out | payout_failed&lt;br&gt;No phone and no wallet id on the command." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p5-wln" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p5-wt" parent="p5-wln" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="&lt;b&gt;processed_event&lt;/b&gt; — event_id PK.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;transactions&lt;/b&gt; — purpose = payout, brand_id = mfg, provider = truemoney. status paying → paid or failed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;attempts&lt;/b&gt; — payment_ref, the TrueMoney transfer id.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;outbox&lt;/b&gt; — gateway job on the command. payment.events on the result." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p5-dln" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p5-dt" parent="p5-dln" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="• Command, so dedupe on event_id. The same payout_id does not pay twice.&lt;br&gt;• The worker takes the job with SKIP LOCKED. A timeout retries that same id.&lt;br&gt;• TrueMoney 5xx: 3× with backoff, then payout_failed and an alert.&lt;br&gt;• A rejected payee is payout_failed with no retry.&lt;br&gt;• Ack after the first commit. Nobody waits on TrueMoney." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p5-nln" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p5-nt" parent="p5-nln" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="• P-25: Delivery publishes the command. This page calls TrueMoney.&lt;br&gt;• P-23: brand_id is mfg. One payout per trip.&lt;br&gt;• P-24: the payee wallet is not on the bus. Payment resolves it from rider_id. Where that ref is stored is open (O-16).&lt;br&gt;• O-16: the TrueMoney merchant account is still open. No schedule and no minimum.&lt;br&gt;• Checkout stays on Omise. TrueMoney is not a second charge provider. 2C2P is still an unshipped port." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>